WEBVTT

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.150
Phew, I'm finally out of the hospital.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.190
It feels good to breathe the air of freedom!

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.910
It's great you were discharged so soon.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.360
But it's the new year already.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.540
What's wrong? Isn't that a reason to celebrate?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.440
It means this fine lady grew a year older,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.210
and she'll graduate in March.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.800
You're welcome to stay with
us for another year.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.260
Uh, I'd rather not...

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.060
Hey, wanna drink amazake?

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:42.810
Oh, sounds good!
Let's go get some!

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.820
Wow, you two are good drinkers.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:53.570
These are non-alcoholic.
Why are you two drunk?

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.280
What's wrong with them?

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.310
This is an important record!

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.730
Yuuna, aren't you gonna drink?

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:08.410
Ah, it's too hot...

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.060
Wasshi, it's an emergency!
We have to blow on it!

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.250
Thank you...

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.840
Hey, Tougou-paisen!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.970
Let's take a picture!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.970
My youth!

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.480
Well then, shall we take one together?

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.480
Okay, get ready!

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.230
Fuu-senpai, just act naturally.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:12.920
Sorry, I couldn't help it.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.910
But it seems like you've been filming
all the time lately, huh?

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:21.680
Since you'll graduate soon, Senpai, I thought it would be important to keep records of our activities together.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:26.610
Just so you know, I'll keep hanging
out here even after graduation.

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.320
Hanging out, huh...

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.730
Well, I expected as much.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.320
You say that, but you look
happy about it, Karin.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.900
Hey, why are you reacting like that?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.370
I'm getting an urge to write when I watch them!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:42.580
Right, Sancho?

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.680
Sí, mucho.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.180
He can talk?!

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:51.670
Fuumin-senpai and Nibosshi stimulated my imagination,
so I'm going home to write a story about them!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.540
Hey!
What?!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.540
See you tomorrow!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.220
Yeah, see you tomorrow!

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.600
See you again, Sonocchi.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.690
Not so fast!

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:05.930
Uhm, by the way, where should
we go for my graduation trip?

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.820
You couldn't go anywhere during
our New Year's holiday, after all.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.000
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.340
How about we make the Taisha pay us a trip to an onsen?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:16.940
We went to an onsen last time, why don't we go somewhere else?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.760
The mountains might be nice this time.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.440
The mountains? I like it!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:26.070
Lost, lost kitty cat, where are you hiding?

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.440
Hmm, we can't find him anywhere.
Hey, did you look over here?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.160
Hey, Itsuki, try calling him in cat language.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.040
Huh?!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.040
Meow! Meow! Meow!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.000
More! Awaken your inner beast!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.740
Nice! Very nice, Ittsun!

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.840
Yes... that's perfect!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.800
Please don't take photos!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.550
Oh! Found you!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.760
Come here, let's take you home.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.580
Oh, there, there.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.520
Nice find, Yuuna.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.520
I scared him.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.020
We found the kitten, so that request's done.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:03.340
Now, Senpai. Let's take a photo to commemorate the occasion.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:04.740
Oh, good idea!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.540
Whew! You're on fire!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.040
You were perfectly in sync, too.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.880
Should we also give it a go, Yuuna?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.220
Huh? Yeah. Let's do our homework.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.300
Huh?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.000
You're half asleep, huh?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.490
Nibosshi, let's sing our hearts out together!

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.560
Uh, sure...

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.320
Yuuna.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.320
Karin-chan.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.540
You got a minute?

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.570
What's up, Karin-chan?

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.480
Can we take a walk?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.830
It's been so long since I came here.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:03.230
I think the last time was when we
went to rescue Tougou-san.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.420
Yuuna, listen.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.010
I need to ask something first.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.390
Aren't you cold, Karin-chan?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.140
Oh, I'm sorry! I didn't notice
you were freezing!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.910
Wanna go somewhere else?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.770
Uh-uh, it's okay.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.770
If I do this,

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:24.480
It's warm!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.470
You know, earlier...

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:32.160
Fuu said she'd still drop by the Hero Club now and then after her graduation, right?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.240
Yeah.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:37.710
I was a bit happy when I heard that.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.250
A bit?

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.420
Just a bit!

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:46.840
Actually, um... a fair bit.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.740
It's great, isn't it?

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.760
Yeah.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.890
So, anyways.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:01.730
I've been trying to talk more
about my feelings these days.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.730
So, Yuuna, you should do the same.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.700
Yuuna, you started acting weird
around the end of last year.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.720
Something happened, didn't it?

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:17.290
I'm here to help you.
Don't you want to tell me about it?

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.370
Yuuna.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.750
There's nothing wrong.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.580
It's okay!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.290
Huh?

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.340
I'll be there for you,
no matter what it is!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.010
Because it's for you, Yuuna!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.890
Karin-chan...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.600
I'll help you!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.520
I'd do anything for you, Yuuna!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.900
I'm so happy I have a friend
I care this much for!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.020
And Yuuna, you and the others
made me feel this way.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.950
Karin-chan?

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.520
What's going on, Yuuna?

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.290
U-Uhm...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:06.530
It really is nothing.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.050
Is that so...

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.090
Karin-chan?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.220
I thought...

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.470
I thought it's "if you're troubled,
talk to someone", am I wrong?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:25.520
I just wanted to help my friend...

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.730
Karin-chan, wait!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.690
Karin-chan!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.130
I'm sorry...

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.550
So sorry...

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:08.150
As I thought, Yuuna-chan has clearly
been acting strange lately.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.540
Oh, I got "excellent fortune!"

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:15.050
Nice!

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.160
That's wrong.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:21.130
Yuuna-chan would normally be exuberant
about getting "excellent fortune!"

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.160
So why...

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.660
Why does she look so sad?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.290
There's no doubt about it. Something must have happened that she can't tell us about.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.000
If that's case...

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.950
I'll get to the bottom of it.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.220
Yuuna-chan...

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.160
You left the lights on...

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.620
I'm sorry for sneaking in.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.810
Are there any clues?

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:21.720
Those are...

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:28.060
Yuuna-chan's parents bought those encyclopedias for her at Ines when she started middle school on April 3rd.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.980
She said she never touched them,
but one is out of place!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.410
Hero Record?

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.540
Why would she have
something like this?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:50.430
Maybe... No, I'm sure of it.
There must be clues in here.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:51.660
But...

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.420
Yuuna-chan, I'm sorry.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.540
I'll be borrowing this.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:19.080
Yuuna wrote this?

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.030
Yuuna-chan's been acting odd lately.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.660
I believe the reason behind
it is written in here.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.440
For her to write something like this...

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.540
May I say something?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.210
Sonocchi?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.880
I was also worried about Yuuyu,
so I tried investigating.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.880
Remember how I've gone home
earlier than everyone else?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.970
Actually, I've been visiting the Taisha.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.510
The Taisha...

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:48.250
To cut to the chase, the reason why
Yuuyu's been acting strange...

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:52.140
is because she's being tormented
by the Heavenly Gods' curse.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.600
Eh?!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.000
Sonocchi, you don't mean-

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.610
Hear me out, Wasshi.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:03.250
According to my investigation at the Taisha, when Yuuyu tries to tell anyone or write about the curse, it will spread.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.540
That's what I found out.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:10.200
That's why this diary is extremely dangerous.

00:12:10.690 --> 00:12:13.460
Knowing this, do you still wish to see it?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.420
I do. I'm worried about Yuuna-chan, after all!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.470
Then let's read it.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.970
Yuuyu's Record.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:39.980
It began at the end of of last year, when people from the Taisha noticed the change and came to my house.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:43.360
They found out about my situation
through investigation and oracles.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.910
They told me they also wanted
me to keep an authentic record,

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:49.440
so they requested that I use
this notebook as a diary.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:51.080
Should I keep going?

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:56.000
Why did it end up like this?

00:12:56.790 --> 00:13:03.760
It seems I pushed myself too hard in the last battle,
and most of my body went through Sange.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:09.840
Also, my soul was absorbed by
the Core when I touched it.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:17.690
The next thing I knew, I was at the place
where I went to save Tougou-san.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.330
An endlessly expanding world.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:38.830
I tried my best to break out of it,

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:44.210
but wherever I went, the world never seemed to end.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:51.420
Girls, help me!

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:57.300
Even when she was alone, the Hero...

00:13:57.300 --> 00:14:01.690
The Hero never gave up fighting.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:02.860
Tougou-san?

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.260
Because she believed that there was hope as long as she didn't give up.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.660
Tougou-san!

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:11.050
Because she believed that there was hope as long as she didn't give up.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.020
Tougou-san.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:16.510
No matter what she lost... No matter what...

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.930
Tougou-san! Tougou-san!
No matter what she lost... No matter what...

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:20.460
Tougou-san!
No matter what...

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.500
No matter what...

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:28.260
I don't want to lose my most precious friend!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.550
Tougou-san is crying.
No! I don't want this!

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.760
You said no matter how sad, no matter how painful,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.270
I... I...

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:37.960
you'd be by my side!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:41.770
I'm a Hero.
you'd be by my side!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:49.410
A Hero would never
leave her friend crying!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:54.030
Heroes are about guts!
I <i>will</i> make it back.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:07.920
A crow?

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:31.540
I felt that the crow wanted me to follow it.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:40.750
That's why I... kept pressing
on towards the light,

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:44.000
and was able to make it back.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:48.130
But it wasn't the same for my body.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:55.100
We all recovered from Sange, but it seems what we offered wasn't actually returned.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:16:00.020
The bodily functions we recovered were actually something created by the Shinju-sama

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:04.020
That's why it took time for
my body to accept them.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.770
Since I forcibly went through
Mankai and Sange,

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:12.230
the Shinju-sama had to create a
completely new body for me.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.030
The Taisha call someone like me a "Misukata".

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:21.490
To put it nicely, a "Misukata" is
considered a very sacred being.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.790
That's why they're favored by the gods.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.040
That's why I...

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:33.800
That's why they granted my wish, and preserved the
world's balance by letting me take my friend's place.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.800
The Taisha noticed the change
and began investigating me.

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:40.280
What they found out...

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.490
was that as long as the world of flames exists,

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:46.310
this body can never heal.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:52.570
And... that I probably won't make
it to the spring of this year.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.260
I'm very scared.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:59.760
I feel guilty that Fuu-senpai
got hurt because of me.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:03.830
I feel like I'm trapped in a tunnel.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:08.340
January 7th.  I'm happy that Fuu-senpai was discharged from the hospital.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:13.340
I feel much better with everyone around,
but I need to be careful not to spread the curse.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.100
As expected, I ended up talking less.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:22.140
I didn't have an appetite, but the amazake was really yummy and felt good on my throat.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.230
But I threw it all up at home.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:32.230
January 9th. I felt really nauseous, but being
in the clubroom eases my heart.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.990
I love hearing the words
"See you tomorrow" lately.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:40.240
I feel like tomorrow will come
if we make that promise.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:43.000
I'd like to stay here forever if I could.

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:47.250
Fuu-senpai suggested a trip to the onsen,

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:52.250
but everyone would be shocked
if they saw me naked now.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:57.260
I really can't go, I'm sorry.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.960
January 11th. I feel great today!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.650
Maybe resting up really did work!

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:06.020
It was fun being able to
move my body around!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.660
With some willpower, maybe I
can continue feeling good.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:13.900
I'll try doing other things that
are good for my body!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:20.960
January 13th. My chest really
hurts and I feel dizzy.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:25.640
I was probably not making sense
when I talked with them.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:29.420
I already thought that my
body was getting better.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:35.920
January 14th. I need to sleep a
lot to recover my strength.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:41.170
But... I'm scared to sleep with the
lights off. I'm afraid of the dark.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:45.560
I feel like I might be swallowed by the darkness.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:52.440
January 16th. Today, I hurt Karin-chan.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.880
But I absolutely cannot tell her.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:58.450
I'm sorry.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.560
It's painful.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.070
My body hurts.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.200
My heart, too.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.940
I feel like I'm being torn apart.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.950
I'm going crazy!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:13.680
I just want to enjoy my daily
life with everyone!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.610
I can't complain now.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:32.440
I'm a Hero. I've prepared myself for this.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.620
I won't cry anymore!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.260
I have to keep at it!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.680
Yuuki Yuuna! Heroes never break!

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:44.260
For now, I want to make up with Karin-chan.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:48.360
But I can't tell her the truth.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:51.090
What should I do?

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.710
I'll write it all down here.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:58.860
Karin-chan, I really love you.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.220
Karin-chan, I'm so sorry.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.310
It can't be...

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:11.100
What did she mean by
"It will never heal"?

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.230
"I won't make it to the
spring of this year"?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.940
Wait, Wasshi!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.150
Don't stop me!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.980
It's all my fault!

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:22.950
The wrath of the Heavenly Gods wasn't quelled!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>I</i> should be the one to bear that curse!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.380
It was written in the diary, wasn't it?

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:31.110
Even if it spread to you,
she'd still remain cursed!

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:32.660
No way...

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:39.490
The Taisha kept something
important from us again!

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:45.400
The curse might have spread if they carelessly
told us, so they decided to keep silent.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:47.430
They didn't inform me, either.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:53.340
I only found out the details about
the curse just moments ago.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.190
Karin-san...

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:03.180
Y-Yuuna was in so much pain, and yet I...

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.450
I...

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:07.570
I said such a terrible things!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.200
I said such a terrible things!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:19.960
Even after learning the truth, we still
couldn't do anything about it.

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:22.460
Good morning!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:24.970
It's frustrating.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.400
Come in!

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.470
Good morning, Yuuna-chan!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.680
Ah, good morning, Tougou-san!

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:35.770
You're awake early today.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.440
Yeah! I woke up early today.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:41.940
But it's so cold that I don't
feel like going out today.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.580
What's wrong, Yuuna-chan?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.700
Tougou-san, you look sick. Are you okay?

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.370
Tougou-san! Tougou-san?

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:02.370
When I was uncertain, she would
always embrace me like this.

00:22:10.670 --> 00:22:15.940
Yuuna-chan. I'll save you
for sure this time!
